{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cI am willing to give everything to become the protagonist in your story, even if I am the ANTAGONIST in the script.\u201d</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1788060/extras/a80478696d4280472c56301b84c06ae8.avif?t=1754151403\" width=472 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abandoned Hansel and Gretel follow the sweet aroma to the candy house. Strangely, although the candy house appears full of wonderful things, it is permeated by an eerie atmosphere. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The two encounter a moody doll, playful and mischievous teddy bears, elusive gingerbread twins, and a witch shrouded in mystery... The sweets here not only satisfy hunger but are also key to unraveling the many mysteries. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Develop recipes, collect ingredients</i></strong>, create various magical sweets, and record them in the <strong><i>dessert book</i></strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some sweets can be used as weapons, increase intelligence, even change form, and can attract mysterious creatures. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step they take is fraught with danger, and <strong><i>every choice they make will alter the course of the story.</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can Hansel and Gretel uncover the dark conspiracies hidden beneath the sweet sugar coating?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1788060?t=1754151403","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1788060/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754151403","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1788060/77a88093b8f5f7045b41684e0534576de638a55f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754151403","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1788060/77a88093b8f5f7045b41684e0534576de638a55f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754151403","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":51},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Commentary available","id":14},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cI am willing to give everything to become the protagonist in your story, even if I am the ANTAGONIST in the script.\u201d</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1788060/extras/a80478696d4280472c56301b84c06ae8.avif?t=1754151403\" width=472 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abandoned Hansel and Gretel follow the sweet aroma to the candy house. Strangely, although the candy house appears full of wonderful things, it is permeated by an eerie atmosphere. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The two encounter a moody doll, playful and mischievous teddy bears, elusive gingerbread twins, and a witch shrouded in mystery... The sweets here not only satisfy hunger but are also key to unraveling the many mysteries. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Develop recipes, collect ingredients</i></strong>, create various magical sweets, and record them in the <strong><i>dessert book</i></strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some sweets can be used as weapons, increase intelligence, even change form, and can attract mysterious creatures. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step they take is fraught with danger, and <strong><i>every choice they make will alter the course of the story.</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can Hansel and Gretel uncover the dark conspiracies hidden beneath the sweet sugar coating?</p>","developers":["CHAyE"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1788060/f9bce33d50f5687625d0a484fbd20b65e7097221/header.jpg?t=1754151403","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1788060/656456/511776e22a9792ea24b82411dd8eca6d36d7ec49/1751031788/dash_av1.mpd?t=1706796551","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1788060/656456/511776e22a9792ea24b82411dd8eca6d36d7ec49/1751031788/dash_h264.mpd?t=1706796551","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1788060/656456/511776e22a9792ea24b82411dd8eca6d36d7ec49/1751031788/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1706796551","id":256997503,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256997503/movie480.mp4?t=1706796551","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256997503/movie_max.mp4?t=1706796551"},"name":"Candy House in the Dark Forest_Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256997503/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1706796551","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256997503/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1706796551","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256997503/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1706796551"}}],"name":"CANDY HOUSE in the DARK FOREST","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or Greater<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 1.06Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"